%% Status: CURRENT — implemented
sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Chat as StudyChat
  participant TS as TanStack chat route
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Compiler
  User->>Chat: current message
  Chat->>TS: message + selected UI language
  TS->>TS: detect supported current-message language
  Note over TS: confident message language > UI language > en
  TS->>API: explicit en/de/gsw/ru/es/fr/it language
  API->>Compiler: validated language
  Compiler-->>API: named response-language instruction
  API-->>Chat: answer + language
  Chat->>Chat: choose TTS locale independently
